# Implementation Plan - Phase 6: Admin Panel Foundation

This phase establishes the administrative foundation for the Leitner Learning Platform, consisting of both backend API capabilities under `/api/v1/admin/` and a React + TypeScript + Vite web-based dashboard utilizing a pluggable architecture.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Admin Authentication:** Rather than introducing a complex password-based login structure for administrators, the system leverages the existing secure OTP (One-Time Password) SMS flow. A new `is_admin` column is added to the `users` table. If the authenticated mobile number has `is_admin = true`, a JWT is issued with the claim `Role: Admin`. This guarantees security consistency and integrates with the self-hosted CAPTCHA verification flow.
> 
> A default admin user with phone number `+989120000000` is seeded in the database. For local testing and development, the backend OTP bypass code `12345` is allowed.

