### Component 3: Administrative APIs & Audit Logging

We will build the `/api/v1/admin` REST endpoints to expose all administrative functions and record logs.

#### [NEW] [IAuditLogService.cs](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/backend/LeitnerPlatform.Core/Interfaces/IAuditLogService.cs)
