#### [NEW] [AdminController.cs](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/backend/LeitnerPlatform.API/Controllers/v1/AdminController.cs)
Provides REST endpoints protected under `[Authorize(Roles = "Admin")]`:
- **Dashboard Stats:** `GET /api/v1/admin/dashboard/stats` (retrieves counts for users, courses, purchases, active cards, and pending reports).
- **User Management:**
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/users`: Search and list users with pagination.
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/users/{id}`: Detailed user info.
  - `PUT /api/v1/admin/users/{id}`: Edit educational details, username, interest fields.
- **Purchase Control (Course Activation):**
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/purchases`: List purchases.
  - `PATCH /api/v1/admin/users/{userId}/courses/{courseId}`: Toggle course purchase state. Publishes `PurchaseCompletedEvent` to trigger off-server backup replication.
  - Audit logs are generated for all manual purchase changes (saving before/after values).
- **Reports/Feedback System:**
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/reports`: View card typo reports.
  - `PATCH /api/v1/admin/reports/{id}`: Resolve/change report status.
- **Announcement & Banner Management:**
  - CRUD operations for announcements (`/api/v1/admin/announcements`) and banners (`/api/v1/admin/banners`).
- **Audit Trails:**
  - `GET /api/v1/admin/audit-logs`: Expose activity logs.

